%% SitePilot hackathon candidate architecture
flowchart LR
  classDef browser fill:#132238,stroke:#7fa8ca,color:#f7fafc,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef google fill:#fff2e5,stroke:#d27b2e,color:#172033,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef deterministic fill:#e8f0f6,stroke:#52738f,color:#172033,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef state fill:#f7f1df,stroke:#b08a34,color:#172033,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef human fill:#e8f3ec,stroke:#3d8d64,color:#172033,stroke-width:1.5px

  U[Anonymous judge / owner]:::human --> B[Browser · confirmed opportunity]:::browser
  B --> V[Vercel Next.js server routes]:::browser
  V -->|OIDC → STS → service-account ID token| CR[Private Cloud Run Taskmaster API]:::google
  CR --> Q[Cloud Tasks queue]:::google
  Q -->|OIDC authenticated delivery| W[Private Cloud Run worker · Node 22]:::google
  W <--> F[(Firestore runs, events, proposals, simulations, allowances)]:::state

  W --> ADK[Google ADK bounded planning]:::google
  ADK --> VX[Vertex AI · Gemini 3.7 Flash · global · v1]:::google
  W --> GEN[Structured three-strategy generation]:::google
  GEN --> VX
  W --> SIM[Deterministic SitePilot simulation and planning checks]:::deterministic
  SIM --> F

  F --> REVIEW[Three-scheme browser review]:::browser
  REVIEW --> H[Human approval required]:::human
  H --> CAN[Accepted canonical scenario and revisions]:::deterministic
  CAN --> OUT[Spatial Console · comparison · CSV/PDF/DAE]:::browser

  CAN --> ASSESS[On-demand grounded assessment]:::google
  F --> ASSESS
  ASSESS --> VX
  ASSESS --> SEP[Authoritative deterministic findings + advisory AI assessment]:::deterministic
  SEP --> B

  FALLBACK[Honest deterministic/template fallback]:::deterministic --> W
